WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:17.916
Hey, it's a giant pink bird!

2
00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:22.321
Who are you?

3
00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:26.093
I'm a flamingo.

4
00:00:26.094 --> 00:00:30.167
Flamingos are waders.

5
00:00:30.168 --> 00:00:35.872
Those are birds that stay near shallow water.

6
00:00:35.873 --> 00:00:38.695
Where do you live?

7
00:00:38.696 --> 00:00:43.581
We live all over the world.

8
00:00:43.582 --> 00:00:49.405
We like lakes, ponds, and oceans.

9
00:00:49.406 --> 00:00:52.521
Do you live alone?

10
00:00:52.522 --> 00:00:55.642
Nope.

11
00:00:55.643 --> 00:01:02.893
Flamingos live together in big groups.

12
00:01:02.894 --> 00:01:08.964
Wow! You can stand on one leg!

13
00:01:08.965 --> 00:01:14.070
Yes, we stand on one leg to rest.

14
00:01:14.071 --> 00:01:18.655
And we stand on two legs to eat.

15
00:01:18.656 --> 00:01:22.722
What do you eat?

16
00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:28.026
We like snails, plants, and fish.

17
00:01:28.027 --> 00:01:40.746
We also eat lots of shrimp.

18
00:01:40.747 --> 00:01:46.238
Their pink color makes our feathers turn pink!

19
00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:50.370
Your neck is so long!

20
00:01:50.371 --> 00:01:54.614
Our long neck helps us to fish.

21
00:01:54.615 --> 00:01:58.832
And our bill is like a shovel.

22
00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:03.356
We use it to scoop up food.

23
00:02:03.357 --> 00:02:05.697
Can you swim?

24
00:02:05.698 --> 00:02:08.653
Oh yes, we can swim.

25
00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:14.438
We have webbed feet.

26
00:02:14.439 --> 00:02:19.030
We can also run on the water.

27
00:02:19.031 --> 00:02:26.555
And fly into the sky!

28
00:02:26.556 --> 00:02:33.401
Good-bye, Flamingo!
